meta {
  name: Get Comment Replies
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/comments/{{commentId}}/replies
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:query {
  skip: 0
  limit: 50
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

docs {
  # Get Comment Replies

  Get all replies to a specific comment (nested comments).

  **Permission Required:** Viewer or higher (for the trip)

  **Query Parameters:**
  - `skip` (optional): Number of records to skip (default: 0)
  - `limit` (optional): Max records to return (default: 50)

  **Notes:**
  - Returns only direct replies to the specified comment
  - Excludes soft-deleted replies
  - Ordered by creation date (oldest first for better conversation flow)
  - Includes user information for reply authors
  - Supports infinite nesting (replies can have replies)
}
